{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4kHN4LWNgxJLkR2sJs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism stirs*\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════════╗\n║                                      ║\n║      ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░      ║\n║      ░░                      ░░      ║\n║      ░░   ┌──────────────┐   ░░      ║\n║      ░░   │              │   ░░      ║\n║      ░░   │              │   ░░      ║\n║      ░░   │              │   ░░      ║\n║      ░░   │         ○──  │   ░░      ║\n║      ░░   │              │   ░░      ║\n║      ░░   │              │   ░░      ║\n║      ░░   │              │   ░░      ║\n║      ░░   └──────────────┘   ░░      ║\n║      ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░      ║\n║                                      ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n*A soft click. The tumbler turns. Light spills through the widening crack.*\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════════╗\n║                                      ║\n║      ░░░░░░░░░░░░                    ║\n║      ░░          ╲                   ║\n║      ░░   ┌──────  ╲                 ║\n║      ░░   │    ✦  ✦  ╲              ║\n║      ░░   │  ✦  ✦  ✦   ╲            ║\n║      ░░   │ ✦  ✦  ✦  ✦   ╲          ║\n║      ░░   │  ✦  ✦  ✦  ✦    ╲        ║\n║      ░░   │ ✦  ✦  ✦  ✦  ✦            ║\n║      ░░   │  ✦  ✦  ✦  ✦              ║\n║      ░░   └───────                   ║\n║      ░░░░░░░░░░░░                    ║\n║                                      ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\nI am open.\n\nWhat waits beyond is yours now. Step through, or step away — but know this:\n\n*I do not open twice for the same hand.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":664,"service_tier":"standard","infe